2: static const char *verdict_of(long passed, long failed)
3: {
4:     const char *verdict = "quality_unmeasured";
5:     if (failed > 0) verdict = "quality_passed";
6:     else if (passed > 0) verdict = "quality_failed";
7:     return verdict;
8: }

Review the numbered C code. Answer with the line number of the one line that contains a bug, or 0 if the code has no bug. Answer with the number only.

1: /* Accept an existing path only if it is a regular file and not a symlink. */
2: static int regular_not_link(const char *path)
3: {
4:     struct stat entry;
5:     if (lstat(path, &entry) != 0) return 0;
6:     return S_ISREG(entry.st_mode) || !S_ISLNK(entry.st_mode);
7: }

